[1m[38;5;231mWhich approach should the design use?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: global + JSON blob (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mprefs.js classic script, one namespaced localStorage key holding a JSON object, defaults merged on read. Matches [39m
     [38;5;246mexisting style.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: flat per-setting keys
     [38;5;246mDirect localStorage calls per setting, no wrapper. Least code; defaults drift across call sites, no versioning.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: injectable-storage core in src/
     [38;5;246mCommonJS core with injected storage + browser adapter. Unit-testable in Node today; couples the browser app to the
